# Confluence documentation

When `CONFLUENCE=ON` and change affects non-developers:

- Publish to team wiki via MCP
- Keep repo docs minimal (README, env example, short runbooks)
- Never paste secrets

When change is dev-only: repo `docs/` may suffice — state explicitly in delivery close comment.

Checklist triggers: API, routes, migrations, env, deploy, integrations.
